# #1360 part 2: the raw-rule and address-list-count push blocks (and the
# address-list block's mv-bl-* exclusion) run on a real CHR 7.18.2, 2026-10-01.
# Each block once at the console with its /tool fetch swapped for :put, then
# all three saved as a script under the push policy (read,test) and run.
# The fixture is probe data: documentation addresses plus the QEMU SLIRP
# gateway (10.0.2.2), so a drop rule's counter moves. No token: "tok".

